Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 19:22:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 64/78] web-app: resizable chat-list sidebar (drag handle,
 persisted width)

A 5px col-resize handle between the chat list and the chat view. Dragging
sets an explicit flex-basis on the sidebar, overriding the default 3:8
split; the width persists in localStorage and is clamped on load and on
drag (min 295px = the pane's existing min-width, max = window minus 400px
for the chat view). Double-click resets to the default split. The handle
is a keyboard-reachable separator (role=separator, ArrowLeft/ArrowRight
resize in 16px steps, direction-aware for RTL). Hidden in small-screen
mode where only one pane is visible anyway.
